  {
    "id": 1002004050010,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "…………私は、ブラックコーヒーが飲めて、料理ができます",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ！？　うん、そうだな……！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0327"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……プロデューサー、余所見は危ないですよ\r\nきちんと前を見て運転してください",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやいやいや、灯織が突然そんなこと言うから……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それほど重大な話ではないですし、勝手に話すので\r\nBGM程度に聞き流してください",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0328",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ええ……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1300
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "たぶん、同世代と比べたら\r\nコーヒーを飲む回数も、料理をする回数も多いです",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "────……おう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "どちらも、私にとって必要だったという理由でしかなくて\r\nやっぱり好きかどうかと聞かれると、よくわかりません",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私にとっては、音楽鑑賞とか、占いとかと一緒なんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……料理は小学生の時からって言ってたな\r\n詳しく聞いてもいいか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そうですね、言ったとおりです\r\n必要に駆られて……という感じで",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "父は今単身赴任していますが、\r\n私が小学生の頃はまだ、家から仕事に出ていて",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "でも、帰りはすごく遅かったんです",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "母も、私が物心ついた頃には仕事に復帰して、\r\n夕飯を一緒には食べられない時間に帰ってきていました",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……それでも、今よりは全然早かったんですけどね",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0790"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "両親は忙しくしているけど、\r\n私は家に帰ってきて、宿題をしたら暇な時間があって──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "毎朝、バタバタしながら\r\n私の夕飯を用意してくれる母を見て、手伝おうと思いました",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050140,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "『できるかぎり、自分のことは自分でやろう\r\nそしたら、お母さんもちょっとは楽になるかも』",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050150,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "これが料理を始めたきっかけです",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織はいい子だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050160,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふふ……こう言えば聞こえはいいですけど\r\n結局、両親に嫌われたくなかったんだと思います",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050170,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "自分たちは仕事で忙しいのに、\r\n疲れて家に帰れば子どもの世話が待っている",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050180,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ああ、帰るの嫌だな、面倒だなって\r\n思われたくなくて",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050190,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ばかみたいですよね\r\n両親がそんなこと思うわけないのに",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今気付いているなら、全然問題ないんじゃないか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050200,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふふっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "コーヒーは？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "子どもがブラックコーヒーって、\r\n結構冒険だと思うんだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050210,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それも似たような理由で──",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050220,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "両親の帰りを待ちたかったんです",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050230,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "でも、夕飯を食べてお風呂に入ると\r\n眠くなってしまうので……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど、それで『眠気覚まし』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050240,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい。……まぁ、小さい頃は全然、\r\nブラックなんて飲めたものじゃなくて",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050250,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ほとんどコーヒー牛乳を飲んでいました\r\n牛乳にコーヒーを足したレベルの",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、ホットミルクが強いと\r\n逆に眠くなりそうだな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050260,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふふ、かもしれません",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050270,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "寝落ちした回数は数知れず……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "コーヒーが仕事できずに終わってるな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050280,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふふふっ\r\nだから、ちょっとずつ割合を増やしていって",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050280"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050290,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "飲めるようになったんです、ブラック",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050290"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050300,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "大きくなってからは、コーヒーに頼らなくても\r\n夜更かしができるようになって",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050300"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050310,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "今、家でブラックはほとんど飲まないですね",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そっか\r\n……ありがとうな。話してくれて",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050320,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あ……いえ\r\nこれは前置きというか、本題は別なんですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050320"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050330,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "────着いちゃいますね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050330"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうだな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "ちょっと\r\n寄り道しようか",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "どこか停めるか",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "明日、事務所で",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050340,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "えっ……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050340"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050350,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あ、いえ\r\n本当に、BGMとして聞いていただければと思っていて",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050350"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050360,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "引き延ばすほどではないので……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050360"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "4"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今聞いてもいいか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050370,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "いえ……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050370"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050380,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサーの時間を奪うわけには……！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050380"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050390,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "大した話でもないので\r\nまた今度、BGMとして聞いていただけたら",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200405/1002004050390"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、わかった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "4"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004050400,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……えっ",
